    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d748">

                <pb facs="0802" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg788"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00/2066a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Secretary of the Navy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Knox</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-04">January 4,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: The American Ambassador
                    at Santiago, Chile,<anchor n="51" xml:id="d748-f1"/> has informed the Department
                    that there have been persistent rumors in Chile that an Axis inspired revolution
                    might occur in that country. The recent revolution in Bolivia has increased the
                    uneasiness in Chile. While the Ambassador has no information pointing to the
                    imminence of a revolutionary movement in Chile, he feels nevertheless that it
                    would be desirable for this Government to send a United States vessel to
                    Valparaiso as a demonstration of solidarity and friendship with the Chilean
                    Government. A report from the United States Ambassador in Buenos Aires<anchor
                        n="51a" xml:id="d748-f2"/> states that the German military attaché is
                    supposed to have said that a revolution in Chile is imminent.</p>
                <p>In view of this situation of possible threat to the defense of the Hemisphere, I
                    believe a courtesy visit of an American cruiser to Valparaiso would be helpful
                    and I would therefore appreciate your endeavoring to arrange for such a visit as
                    soon as practicable.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
